    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis three-bedroom detached bungalow is situated in the townland of Bealaha, Doonbeg, ideally positioned along the Wild Atlantic Way on the main Kilkee to Doonbeg road. Located approximately 4.5 km from Doonbeg village and 6 km from the popular seaside resort of Kilkee, the property enjoys an excellent coastal location, with White Strand and Kilkee beaches both within a short drive.\nThe accommodation itself includes a reception room with distant ocean views, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms (one en-suite) and main bathroom. The property is serviced by oil-fired central heating, mains water and a septic tank. \nThe surrounding coastline is ideal for outdoor enthusiasts, with golfing, cliff walks, cycling, diving and a variety of water sports all on offer. Doonbeg and nearby Kilkee offer a wide range of amenities and everyday services. \nWith its convenient location between two popular coastal destinations, this property would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, those looking to move to the coast or those looking to acquire a holiday home along the Wild Atlantic Way.\nViewing strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 5.65m 1.75m\nTimber flooring, wall mounted display unit, doors to main reception, kitchen dining, bedroom one, two and three and main bathroom.\n\nMain Reception - 5.3m x 4.2m\nCarpeted flooring, rear aspect window with distant ocean views, double glass doors leading to the rear garden, raised electric fireplace tv point and door to bedroom three.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.7m x 3.15m\nTile flooring, rear aspect window, rear door access, built-in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, tile spash back, single drainer sink, integrated oven, ceramic hob and overhead extractor hood and fan, space for fridge freezer and space and plumbing for washing machine.\n\nBedroom One - 5.35m x 3.65m\nTimber style flooring and front aspect window.\n\nBedroom Two - 4.35m x 3.45m\nTimber style flooring and front aspect window.\n\nMain Bathroom - 4.7m x 3.15m\nTile flooring, rear aspect window, half wall tiling, low level wc, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror, corner fitted bath unit and separate shower unit with tile splash back and overhead electric shower.\n\nBedroom Three Mater En-Suite - 4.55m x 3.15m\nCarpeted flooring, front aspect window and door to en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 3.2m x 1.5m\nTile flooring, side aspect window, low level wc, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror, corner fitted shower tray with overhead pump shower and glass panel shower door.\n\nAdjoining Garage - 4.75m x 2.9m\nConcrete flooring, houses oil tank, roller shutter door to the front, separate section houses oil burner with access to the side.\n\nOutside - \nFront - Block wall boundaries to the front and sides, cobble lock driveway with two entrances, a low maintenance gravel area for shrubs and access to the garage.Rear - Lawn area with mature shrubs and mature hedging.\n\n"
      },
